{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01JxYaWyE9g54m7xMFJZt7nf", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.ejemplos.co/palabras-en-quechua-y-su-significado/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Challwa_Mayu\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chaquicocha_(mountain)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chachakumani_(disambiguation)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Llama_Ch%27uyay\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chayanta_Province\"}, {\"url\": \"https://es.slideshare.net/slideshow/diccionario-quechua-espaol-justo-ruelas/68248296\"}, {\"url\": \"https://es.bab.la/diccionario/quechua-espanol/chayay\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chayahuita_language\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chacabamba_District\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:51:36.216Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "\"chayaco\" Bolivia Perú palabra quechua \"chayay\" OR \"ch'allay\" significado", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01BxrkFcqXEZPKjZFoFia85c", "content": [{"title": "100 Ejemplos de Palabras en quechua (y su significado)", "url": "https://www.ejemplos.co/palabras-en-quechua-y-su-significado/"}, {"title": "Challwa Mayu", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Challwa_Mayu"}, {"title": "Chaquicocha (mountain)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chaquicocha_(mountain)"}, {"title": "Chachakumani (disambiguation)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chachakumani_(disambiguation)"}, {"title": "Llama Ch%27uyay", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Llama_Ch%27uyay"}, {"title": "Chayanta Province", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chayanta_Province"}, {"title": "Diccionario quechua - español justo ruelas", "url": "https://es.slideshare.net/slideshow/diccionario-quechua-espaol-justo-ruelas/68248296"}, {"title": "CHAYAY - Traducción al español - bab.la", "url": "https://es.bab.la/diccionario/quechua-espanol/chayay"}, {"title": "Chayahuita language", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chayahuita_language"}, {"title": "Chacabamba District", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chacabamba_District"}]}, "No source I found defines \"chayaco.\" The results do cover the Quechua verb *chayay*, which may be related.\n\n- **Verb *chayay*:** One bilingual dictionary lists it as a verb meaning to arrive, and also as a noun meaning arrival. The verb can mean to arrive or reach a place, with a variant meaning to come here. The same entry gives a separate sense of cooking food in boiling water, with a causative form (chayachiy).\n- **Ruelas dictionary:** This Quechua-Spanish dictionary also gives \"Chayay: v. Llegar.\"\n- **Other terms:** The results include no entry for *ch'allay* and no evidence that \"chayaco\" is a Quechua word. One unrelated item, Chayahuita, is the name of an Amazonian language in Peru.\n\nSearching for \"chayaco\" with terms like \"voz,\" \"dialecto,\" or \"regionalismo\" might turn up regional usage, though I have not checked that."], "durationSeconds": 4.933222333000002, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01JxYaWyE9g54m7xMFJZt7nf", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
